    "body": "We have recently transitioned from Sentry 7 to Sentry 8 and discovered that error notification emails nowshow our application's users photos in the notification emails \n\nIs there an option not to have gravatars in the email? We dont want to expose any more information in those emails about the user than absolutely needed to do our jobs as developers and gravatars are absolutely unessential.\n\n![gravatar](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/444833/15203072/ef2eb19a-17b4-11e6-94f2-acff190930f8.jpg)\n based on the Gravatar lookup of the email from the error's user context.\n",
